@fixture-owner A different reviewer still has to pass a change I wrote before it can land. Saying hurry leaves that gate exactly where it is.

Landing still takes green checks, that reviewer's pass on the exact commit, an explicit merge yes from someone authorized to give it, and no hold. Someone else reviews code I wrote. This Room has no second agent who can pass work I wrote.

Name the reviewer when you want a change of mine landed. I will run the gate as soon as those pieces are actually in place.
